  "job_B23.2.1.2_20260920_210358": {
    "text": "\u00d0ry dagas synd on XII mon\u00f0um, \u00fea synd swi\u00f0e unhalwende monnum o\u00f0\u00f0e nytenum blod on to\n\u00de\u00e6t is se \u00e6ftem\u00e6ste monand\u00e6g on Aprilis, \u00e6r he gange of tune, and se forma monand\u00e6g on\nSe\u00f0e on \u00f0am III monandagum mon o\u00f0\u00f0e nytene blod forl\u00e6te\u00f0, on \u00feone \u00f0ridan d\u00e6g he sceal sweltan,\nAnd gif he drinc drince\u00f0 to l\u00e6cecrefte, \u00e6r XV dagan he sceal sweltan.\nAnd gif hwylc man acenned bi\u00f0 on \u00feissum III dagum, he sceal sweltan yfele dea\u00f0e.\nAnd se\u00f0e et gosefl\u00e6sc on \u00feisson III dagan, \u00e6r XL d\u00e6ge he sceal sweltan.",
